# Copy this file to a local "keystore.properties" (NOT gradle.properties) if you want to
# sign release builds locally instead of through GitHub Actions secrets.
#
# storeFile=/absolute/path/to/release.keystore
# storePassword=CHANGE_ME
# keyAlias=kira
# keyPassword=CHANGE_ME
#
# NEVER commit a real keystore.properties or a real keystore file to git.
# For CI builds, configure these GitHub Actions secrets instead (see README.md):
#   KEYSTORE_BASE64, KEYSTORE_PASSWORD, KEY_ALIAS, KEY_PASSWORD
#
# For the OpenAI-backed chat provider, the API key is entered by the user at runtime
# in Settings -> API configuration. It is never stored in source code or in this file.
